          "id": 1156073768,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Sorry, but what's the purpose of `CUSTOM_DISSECTOR_SUPPORT_SRC` when we already have `CUSTOM_DISSECTOR_SRC`?  Also, this should reference bug #16259 and that bug should be closed.",
