        {
          "id": 1156122993,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Support source files are given [their own source group](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/f2105250faa9df12bfd831122496c3f1dbbe96fb/epan/dissectors/CMakeLists.txt#L2073), so I assumed the distinction was significant. The main intent of the patch was to meet the need described in #16259 (before I knew it had already been filed), and I tried to future-proof it. Clearly (as per your other comment) I fell short in that second goal.",
